      },
      {
        "name": "Explanation",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "The reply names the mechanism precisely: under `set -euo pipefail`, `diff` in an assignment exits 1 on differing files and `grep` exits 1 on no match, carried through by pipefail, so the script died before printing anything; it also says what was reproduced and tested."
      }
    ],
